    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just \"trauma\". i've looked at the data. i've looked at my track record. every project i start, every venture i lead, it follows the exact same curve of growth followed by total collapse. it's like i'm a constant in an equation where the only solution is zero. how can you call it a \"common reaction\" when the pattern is this consistent? it feels less like a feeling and more like a fundamental property of my existence.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
